# The manual-test vault is a *real clone of a real ADO wiki* with its own .git, so it can
# never be tracked here: git records a nested repository as a gitlink (160000 commit <sha>),
# which both leaks that wiki's content and hands every cloner a broken submodule pointer.
# Recreate it locally by cloning a disposable wiki — see docs/TEST-PLAN.md.
